abstract: >
  Pre Civilization 1 establishes the scalar-field-first foundation for
  multi-pipeline coherence architecture, integrating formal Lean 4 proofs,
  AWG controllers, hydro-coherence modules, and telemetry schema for
  Federation Nodes. This release anchors the Scalar Coherence Theorem and
  provides reproducible artifacts for research, engineering, and
  civilization-scale modeling.

